// The executable's icon, as Windows Explorer and the taskbar show it.
//
// Drawn by tools/make_logo.py from the same polygons as the launcher emblem
// (assets/icons/Logo.svg), and written at each standard icon size rather than
// scaled from one. The .ico is committed so the build needs no Python; run the
// script again if the emblem changes.
IDI_ICON1 ICON "../assets/AppIcon.ico"
